WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:26.870
The computer on the lunar  base of Moonland, Gloria,

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:30.610
indicated that the Ide's energy is infinite.

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:37.840
However, the death of the cooperator Colbock left Sheryl deeply grieved.

00:01:40.050 --> 00:01:45.090
Meanwhile, Gije Zaral ejected from
his Heavy Mobile Mecha Galbo Jick.

00:01:45.310 --> 00:01:49.990
Unable to receive aid from Daram Zuba, he was left alone on the moon.

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:57.620
<b>Wrath of the Wave Leader Gun</b>

00:02:30.690 --> 00:02:32.560
An Earth Union Military warship is approaching!

00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:34.460
All crew, standby and await for orders!

00:02:35.690 --> 00:02:37.430
Here they come at last...

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:39.920
Doesn't look like they're here to throw a welcome party...

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:54.960
I am Inspector General Frendali Limitter
of the Earth Union Military.

00:02:55.430 --> 00:03:00.420
You are to hand over control of the Solo Ship
and Ideon to the Union Military right now!

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:04.050
All crew, get off the ship!

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:06.420
What's this all of a sudden?!

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:08.480
At least give us a reason!

00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:11.480
I am the one in charge of
the Solo Ship, Jordan Bes.

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:12.810
Why do we...

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:16.110
You have used the computer
Gloria without military authorization,

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:18.230
and brought the aliens here!

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:22.950
You operated the Moonland computer
Gloria without permission!

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:23.950
No way!

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:28.930
If I may ask, how do you justify ignoring our emergency signal?

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:32.310
We've put our lifes on the line
 by fighting the Buff Clan!

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:36.390
We were just about to understand how the Ide works, and now you come here!

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:37.750
Main Cannon!

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:38.670
Yes sir!

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:40.070
Primary gun turrets, fire!

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:47.040
I have no time to argue with you people!

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:51.190
If you don't obey within five minutes,
we will all open fire on you!

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:57.270
We can't afford to do that!

00:03:58.730 --> 00:03:59.150
Bes!

00:04:00.860 --> 00:04:01.650
I know!

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:14.680
We still have a Heavy Mobile Mecha Galbo Jick,

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:17.090
and a number of Zurow Jicks left in our arsenal.

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:22.120
Combined with our flagship Dorowa Zan, we can still set out to one last battle.

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:23.010
I'm counting on you.

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:26.310
Supreme Commander Doba has finally
 ordered the military to move out as well.

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:31.600
If our Foundation gains control of the Giant before them, we'll have the advantage.

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:32.850
Yes sir.

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:35.600
However, should you fail in this mission,

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:38.320
the Foundation will have no choice but to combine forces with Doba.

00:04:39.190 --> 00:04:40.280
Even if it pains me...

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:49.780
Meanwhile, on the Buff Clan home planet...

00:04:50.030 --> 00:04:54.680
A fleet of warships was setting off from the Buff Clan Central Command Base.

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:10.720
What can that upstart Rukuku Kil do?

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:13.770
Don't be so harsh.

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:18.360
A woman who believes in
Emperor Zuou still has her uses.

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:23.860
If we allow the peace and order we enjoy under Emperor Zuou...

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:28.500
to be threatened by violent aliens utilizing
 the Ide, it will be a disaster for the Buff Clan.

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:32.870
That speech you gave earlier, father...

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:36.090
It was like a perfect example of treachery.

00:05:36.210 --> 00:05:37.710
Don't say that.

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:41.170
Well then, shall we go see Sir Gindoro Jinmu?

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:45.010
Without the financial aid of his foundation,
we won't be able to overthrow Zuou.

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:50.140
Always so busy...

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:56.600
One minute left...

00:05:57.020 --> 00:05:57.600
Bes!

00:05:57.850 --> 00:05:59.060
We can return fire any time.

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:01.280
Sheryl? Why are you heading out?!

00:06:01.610 --> 00:06:02.320
Sheryl?!

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:03.440
What has Sheryl done?!

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:05.400
She's launched on a small craft!

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:10.110
Sheryl! What are you doing?!

00:06:10.740 --> 00:06:13.420
I was the one who used Gloria!
I'll try to negotiate!

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:14.470
Sheryl!

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:16.040
Cosmo!

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:18.250
Sheryl launched on a small craft! Stop her!

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:19.120
Roger!

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:20.500
Sol Amber, launching!

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:28.470
Sheryl!

00:06:28.470 --> 00:06:31.160
If you want the research the Ide, wouldn't it be better to stay on the Solo Ship?

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:33.560
If they catch you, they'll never let you return!

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:38.130
We need to prevent Earthlings from
 fighting each other at any cost, Cosmo!

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:40.040
If we don't...

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:42.620
Sheryl, aren't you just trying
 to return to Earth alone?

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:43.560
Cosmo!

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:45.650
You still doubt me after all this time?

00:06:45.860 --> 00:06:49.910
The most important thing right now is to avoid infighting!

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:51.830
That's why I'm going.

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:54.040
Why'd you head out alone, then?

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:55.800
You should have taken someone with you!

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:02.080
Looks like they're quarreling among themselves.

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:03.040
Calm them down!

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:10.710
Couldn't they have waited a little longer?!

00:07:11.050 --> 00:07:12.590
We're having an important conversation!

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:13.800
Cosmo, do you understand?

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:17.440
While I buy you guys time,
get away from the moon!

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:19.060
You expect me to believe that?

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:32.360
So you're the one who used Gloria...

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:33.570
Yes.

00:07:33.990 --> 00:07:37.460
You think you'll be the sole
person put at fault for this?

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:41.960
If the military uses the Ide, it will put
humanity down the path of destruction!

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:46.450
If the Ide reacts to a self-defense instinct, its power will shield us like a barrier.

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:48.170
Isn't that so?

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:51.010
How do you know?

00:07:51.510 --> 00:07:53.840
Gloria's mainframe is on Earth.

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:55.800
But...

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:58.510
We still don't understand the Ide's control system...

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:00.470
The military will look into it.

00:08:00.810 --> 00:08:03.610
The Ide can't be entrusted to the military!

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:05.960
There's the issue with the aliens, and also...

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:09.670
We need to stop these strange meteors that have been falling for the past few years!

00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:12.660
It's me.

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:15.110
What? Aliens?!

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:16.390
It's the Buff Clan!

00:08:16.990 --> 00:08:18.490
They've entered the third battle line!

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:20.490
All units, launch immediately!

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:22.120
Get into formation and intercept them!

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:22.790
Roger!

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:26.960
Oh, Bes!

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:29.180
The Earth Union Military fleet is moving out!

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:34.720
Sheryl is still on board, Cosmo!

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:36.120
It's not my problem!

00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:40.850
Inspector General Limitter!

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:42.980
You don't know how powerful the enemy is yet!

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:44.030
You're far too hasty!

00:08:58.660 --> 00:09:00.200
Enemy units are coming this way!

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:01.790
Launch a counterattack!

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:02.370
Yes sir!

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:46.120
Did they shoot our cruisers?

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:47.580
The cruisers?!

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:52.550
You're fighting against the Buff Clan now!

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:57.090
Cosmo, Kasha, Moera!

00:09:57.340 --> 00:10:00.580
Show the Earth military how
 you're supposed to fight them!

00:10:12.650 --> 00:10:13.660
Damn!

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:17.030
Go down!

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:21.870
Cosmo!

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:22.700
To the upper left!

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:25.950
Kasha!

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:28.830
Stay sharp! There are still two units behind us!

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:43.010
Distance, 18 units!

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:45.240
Large enemy warship at 10 o'clock!

00:10:45.510 --> 00:10:47.190
Main cannons, prepare to fire all at once!

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:48.520
Yes sir!

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:51.220
The Musashi's main cannon should do the trick, right?

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:53.270
Well, I wouldn't count on it...

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:54.320
Seriously?

00:10:54.740 --> 00:10:56.690
Well, let's hope for the best!

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:17.700
Keep firing!

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:19.090
Ms. Sheryl!

00:11:19.090 --> 00:11:20.590
It's fine! We can win!

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:30.500
Don't flinch!

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:33.160
Only one more hit and they're done for! Don't flinch!

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:42.680
It's that headache machine! Don't face it head on!

00:11:47.030 --> 00:11:48.040
Kasha! Moera!

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:50.040
We need to fight as one! Get ready to dock!

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:50.930
Roger!

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:26.850
Can we really fight against the headache machine?

00:12:27.190 --> 00:12:29.810
If we attack from the side or behind, it'll be fine! Let's go!

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:41.970
Behind us?!

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:56.020
Cosmo, we're not going to win like this!

00:12:58.110 --> 00:12:59.320
Damn it!

00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:00.820
This isn't going as planned...

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:02.920
Oh yes!

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:05.360
A few days back, we discovered that Ideon Gun!

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:09.920
It was partly buried under the floor, so
we thought it was a part of the engine.

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:12.200
It looks more like a cannon to me...

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:14.540
Yeah, no doubt about it.

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:18.870
Looks like it's supposed to connect to the
 Mini-Black Hole hatch on the Ideon's chest.

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:21.650
The weapon's energy must originate from there.

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:25.930
See, the Ideon's hands fit
here and there are energy tubes.

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:27.180
Should we use it?!

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:29.100
Let's head back!

00:13:29.260 --> 00:13:30.260
We'll return to the Solo Ship!

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:36.310
Deck, keep an eye out.

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:37.350
Roger!

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:38.230
Bes!

00:13:38.230 --> 00:13:40.120
Send out the Ideon Gun! I'll try using it!

00:13:40.480 --> 00:13:41.190
The Ideon Gun?!

00:13:41.610 --> 00:13:42.440
Can we use it, Joliver?

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:43.400
Huh?

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:45.900
We've only checked the energy tubes!

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:47.070
It hasn't been tested yet!

00:13:47.450 --> 00:13:48.750
Let the Ideon test it!

00:13:58.170 --> 00:13:58.710
Cosmo!

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:01.170
We don't know its energy limits!

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:03.920
Don't overheat the Ideon's engine!

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:04.840
I understand!

00:14:05.010 --> 00:14:05.810
I'll be careful!

00:14:08.050 --> 00:14:09.140
The enemy's to the left!

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:14.560
Hurry up!

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:21.730
Cosmo! Behind us!

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:22.320
What?!

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:34.490
It won't fire?!

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:39.040
It's not working! The Ideon Gauge isn't rising!

00:14:39.710 --> 00:14:40.630
My head!

00:14:47.050 --> 00:14:47.970
Okay!

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:02.400
Inspector General Limitter!

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:05.190
Please don't get in the Ideon's
way during this fight!

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:07.360
What are you saying?!

00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:10.230
Our military is enough to handle this enemy!

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:11.720
You just stay back!

00:15:12.240 --> 00:15:13.240
I refuse!

00:15:13.240 --> 00:15:14.660
You won't be able to win this fight!

00:15:15.490 --> 00:15:18.370
Inspector General! Is this the way the
Earth Union Military does things?!

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:19.330
Hey!

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:23.420
It's becoming increasingly clear that
we can't let you have the Ideon!

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:26.280
Take this woman into the detainment room!

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:27.990
Yes sir! Come with us.

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:30.580
Cruiser Yukikaze! Fire the torpedoes!

00:15:36.470 --> 00:15:37.720
The Yukikaze's been destroyed!

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:40.810
That leaves just this Musashi!

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:44.040
The Gerowa Zan will take care of the remaining warship.

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:47.680
You just concentrate
your attack on the Giant with the Galbo Jick.

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:48.320
Yes sir!

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:04.930
Good, continue to pull it along!

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:06.180
We can get it with one attack!

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:17.800
Okay, get closer!

00:16:18.350 --> 00:16:19.300
Finish them off!

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:47.040
The Musashi has been sunk?!

00:16:47.460 --> 00:16:48.250
Buff Clan!

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:51.410
Assist the Galbo Jick!

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:53.180
The Giant must be stopped!

00:16:56.760 --> 00:16:59.310
The enemy is concentrating its attack on the Ideon! Hurry!

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:07.730
The energy isn't rising?

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:09.900
There's the headache machine again!

00:17:09.980 --> 00:17:10.850
Let's do this!

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:20.200
What?!

00:17:45.890 --> 00:17:49.160
What in the world was that weapon!?

00:17:49.690 --> 00:17:51.300
The Ideon Gun fired...

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:54.800
Even though we only used a small amount of energy...

00:17:54.940 --> 00:17:57.530
Both the warship and the Heavy Mobile
Mecha were gone in an instant...

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:02.240
That's right!

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:03.830
Aim well.

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:07.190
All of this happened because
 of the Ideon and Solo Ship!

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:12.420
Even if it's just one shot, I have to make them pay for this!

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:14.710
Fire!

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:21.550
The Musashi?!

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:22.680
Inspector General Limitter!

00:18:22.930 --> 00:18:23.810
We're your ally!

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:24.640
We're...

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:25.520
Fire!

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:27.600
Keep firing until there's no energy left!

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:34.150
Bes! I'm going to fire back!

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:35.110
Stop!

00:18:35.110 --> 00:18:36.070
They're our allies!

00:18:36.570 --> 00:18:37.650
Our allies!

00:18:37.650 --> 00:18:38.490
You mustn't fire!

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:48.790
That Ideon...

00:18:50.370 --> 00:18:51.960
It's not a mere robot!

00:18:52.210 --> 00:18:53.030
It's cursed...

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:54.880
There's a curse on it!

00:18:58.800 --> 00:19:01.910
Cosmo! Sheryl is still inside the Musashi!

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:03.180
We need to help her fast!

00:19:03.550 --> 00:19:04.390
Cosmo!

00:19:05.470 --> 00:19:09.280
You want us to help Sheryl?

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:11.960
Of course!

00:19:12.340 --> 00:19:15.720
Sheryl knows about the Ide more than anyone on the Solo Ship!

00:19:50.550 --> 00:19:52.130
After Colbock, it's me?

00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:57.440
Open up!

00:19:57.440 --> 00:19:58.860
Open the door!

00:19:58.860 --> 00:19:59.570
Open it!

00:20:00.070 --> 00:20:00.860
Open it!

00:20:02.150 --> 00:20:02.860
Open it!

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:10.290
It's Sheryl!

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:12.120
Someone open the door!

00:20:22.760 --> 00:20:23.780
Sheryl!

00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:25.280
It's me, Sheryl!

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:29.390
I'm Formossa Sheryl! Get me out! The fire's drawing near!

00:20:30.020 --> 00:20:31.560
I beg you, help me!

00:20:33.190 --> 00:20:34.190
Get me out!

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:36.400
The Ideon!

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:44.110
Cosmo?!

00:20:44.950 --> 00:20:45.860
Lift her up!

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:56.790
Cosmo...

00:20:57.340 --> 00:20:58.560
Why'd you save me?

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:03.750
Because of Deck... Deck scolded me.

00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:07.090
But tell me the truth.

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:10.390
Even if I had thought about
returning to Earth alone,

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:13.200
after witnessing all that happened today...

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:17.960
I've realized that the Solo Ship
is the only place where I can stay.

00:21:18.280 --> 00:21:20.110
Is that wrong?

00:21:20.110 --> 00:21:20.780
No...

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:32.740
Hurry up, get on!

00:21:32.870 --> 00:21:35.510
Those who don't want to go to the Solo Ship will be left behind!

00:22:37.980 --> 00:22:39.350
Idiots!

00:22:49.990 --> 00:22:53.440
<i>The Buff Clan's regular military returns to fight.</i>

00:22:54.370 --> 00:22:57.410
<i>After getting past the obstructions on Moonland,</i>

00:22:57.750 --> 00:23:00.790
<i>the Ideon is chased down by new
 enemy machines one after another.</i>

00:23:02.250 --> 00:23:08.260
<i>At that time, the rise of the Ideon
 Gauge grants a new light to the Ideon.</i>

00:23:09.590 --> 00:23:14.490
